# West side pawnbroker, buys relics, collects Marla's rent. Flags: rent_waived, rent_paid, rent_watch_sold
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Pawn and loan. Relics from the wall, dog tags, watches: I pay fair and I ask nothing.
+ Buying?
#
o_text: Show me what you have.
o_id: rook_trade
o_effect: StartTrading
o_goto: Default
#
o_text: Marla's rent. It waits.
o_id: rook_intimidate
o_cond: !HasFlag('rent_paid') && !HasFlag('rent_waived') && !HasFlag('rent_watch_sold') && !HasFlag('rent_ledger_torn')
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Easy')
o_succ: Waived
o_fail: NotWaived
#
o_text: (Ask to see the back shelf. While he turns, tear Marla's page out of his ledger.)
o_id: rook_ledger
o_cond: !HasFlag('rent_paid') && !HasFlag('rent_waived') && !HasFlag('rent_watch_sold') && !HasFlag('rent_ledger_torn') && !HasFlag('rook_ledger_caught')
o_test: RollSkill('stealth', 'Medium')
o_succ: LedgerTorn
o_fail: LedgerCaught
#
o_text: Marla is paying. Her husband's watch.
o_id: rook_watch
o_cond: HasFlag('rent_watch_sold')
o_goto: Watch
#
o_text: Nothing today.
o_id: rook_leave
o_goto: End

name: Waived
npc: (He puts both hands flat on the counter.) The widow's rent can wait. A month. Two. I was going to say so anyway.
effect: SetFlag('rent_waived')
#
o_text: I know you were.
o_id: rook_waived_done
o_goto: End

name: NotWaived
npc: Rent is rent. You want to pay it, pay it. You want to threaten me, there is a baton under this counter.
#
o_text: Noted.
o_id: rook_not_waived_leave
o_goto: End

name: LedgerTorn
npc: Back shelf is relics, nothing for you. (He never looks at the ledger. Marla's page is in your pocket.)
effect: SetFlag('rent_ledger_torn')
#
o_text: Maybe next time.
o_id: rook_ledger_done
o_goto: End

name: LedgerCaught
npc: (His hand lands on the ledger before yours does.) That book stays on my side of the counter.
effect: SetFlag('rook_ledger_caught')
#
o_text: Just looking.
o_id: rook_ledger_leave
o_goto: End

name: Watch
npc: Good steel. Window piece. (He is already clearing a spot.)
effect: SetFlag('rook_has_watch')
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: watch_back
o_goto: Default

name: End
npc: Door's where you left it.
effect: EndConversation
